<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link><description>India News Today: Get latest India news and breaking news from India on Times of India. TOI brings the top news headlines from India on Politics, Elections, Current Affairs and more</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-11-03T16:55:08+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/-2128936835.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Tue, 03 Nov 2026 16:55:08 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[Bhutan's glacial lake outburst exposes growing disaster threat across the Himalayas]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bhutans-glacial-lake-outburst-exposes-growing-disaster-threat-across-the-himalaya/articleshow/135494207.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135494207.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Bhutan experienced a significant glacial lake outburst that raised concerns regarding devastating glacial floods in the Himalayas. Authorities are monitoring a temporary lake created by debris from the initial flood event. The risks posed by melting glaciers are increasingly threatening both infrastructure and communities across the region. India, sharing river systems with Bhutan, has started its own review of disaster preparedness plans.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bhutans-glacial-lake-outburst-exposes-growing-disaster-threat-across-the-himalaya/articleshow/135494207.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bhutans-glacial-lake-outburst-exposes-growing-disaster-threat-across-the-himalaya/articleshow/135494207.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T16:50:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135494545,imgsize-383882.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Incompatible with secular character': Centre tells Delhi HC mosque inside Krishi Bhawan must be demolished]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mosque-inside-krishi-bhawan-cannot-be-retained-site-needed-for-central-vista-project-centre-to-delhi-hc/articleshow/135491629.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135491629.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mosque-inside-krishi-bhawan-cannot-be-retained-site-needed-for-central-vista-project-centre-to-delhi-hc/articleshow/135491629.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mosque-inside-krishi-bhawan-cannot-be-retained-site-needed-for-central-vista-project-centre-to-delhi-hc/articleshow/135491629.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T15:20:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135491714,imgsize-70694.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ex-Air chief AP Singh wrote to Rajnath, urged him to keep Race Course land under IAF control]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ex-air-chief-ap-singh-wrote-to-rajnath-u