ps://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/huge-impact-on-polls-ib-opposes-shifting-convict-in-ex-punjab-cm-beant-singhs-assassination-to-state-jail/articleshow/135489885.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T14:48:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135490662,imgsize-763291.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[J&amp;K: Omar Abdullah faces setback as Srinagar MP Aga Ruhullah quits NC, resigns from Parliament]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jk-omar-abdullah-faces-setback-as-srinagar-mp-aga-ruhullah-resigns-from-post-amid-nc-turmoil/articleshow/135490228.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135490228.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jk-omar-abdullah-faces-setback-as-srinagar-mp-aga-ruhullah-resigns-from-post-amid-nc-turmoil/articleshow/135490228.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jk-omar-abdullah-faces-setback-as-srinagar-mp-aga-ruhullah-resigns-from-post-amid-nc-turmoil/articleshow/135490228.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T14:38:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135490355,imgsize-1095199.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Gaddar': BJP accuses Rahul Gandhi of treason, calls him 'Bhasmasur']]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/gaddar-bjp-accuses-rahul-gandhi-of-treason-calls-him-bhasmasur/articleshow/135488400.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135488400.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[BJP spokesperson Gaurav Bhatia accused Rahul Gandhi of treason and promoting anarchy in India's democracy. He raised questions about Gandhi's foreign engagements and the Congress's MoU with the Communist Party of China. Allegations included inappropriate conduct towards a woman police officer during protests against the Chief Election Commissioner. Bhatia warned the opposition leaders about the potential backlash from the public regarding their calls for regime change.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/gaddar-bjp-accuses-rahul-gandhi-of-treason-calls-him-bhasmasur/articleshow/135488400.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/gaddar-bjp-accuses-rahul-gandhi-of-treason-calls-him-bhasmasur/articleshow/135488400.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T14:10:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135489605,imgsize-60924.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Inspired by Rahul Gandhi': BJP targets AISA's Neha Bora over 'Brahmanvaad' remarks]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/inspired-by-rahul-gandhi-bjp-targets-aisas-neha-bora-over-brahmanvaad-remarks/articleshow/135488169.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135488169.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/inspired-by-rahul-gandhi-bjp-targets-aisas-neha-bora-over-brahmanvaad-remarks/articleshow/135488169.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/inspired-by-rahul-gandhi-bjp-targets-aisas-neha-bora-over-brahmanvaad-remarks/articleshow/135488169.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T13:37:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135488244,imgsize-1432057.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[PM Modi inaugurates Pune Metro's 23-km Pink Line, says India's network now 1,200 km]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pm-modi-inaugurates-pune-metros-23-km-pink-line-says-indias-network-now-1200-km/articleshow/135488498.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135488498.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pm-modi-inaugurates-pune-metros-23-km-pink-line-says-indias-network-now-1200-km/articleshow/135488498.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pm-modi-inaugurates-pune-metros-23-km-pink-line-says-indias-network-now-1200-km/articleshow/135488498.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T13:37:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135488597,imgsize-2182.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[India, Israel vote against Pakistan-backed UN arms control resolution: What it means]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-israel-vote-against-pakistan-backed-un-arms-control-resolution-what-it-means/articleshow/135487897.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135487897.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In a significant move, India and Israel opposed a UN resolution proposed by Pakistan and Belarus concerning regional arms control. Despite its adoption with strong backing, both nations voiced serious reservations. India's delegate argued that national security transcends geographic lines, highlighting the potential distraction from established UN disarmament agreements. Additionally, India expressed concerns regarding specific references to South Asian arms control measures present in the resolution.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-israel-vote-against-pakistan-backed-un-arms-control-resolution-what-it-means/articleshow/135487897.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-israel-vote-against-pakistan-backed-un-arms-control-resolution-what-it-means/articleshow/135487897.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T13:20:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135488153,imgsize-92157.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Can't occupy a site for all times': SC on Delhi protests against CEC Gyanesh Kumar]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cant-occupy-a-site-for-all-times-sc-on-delhi-protests-against-cec-gyanesh-kumar/articleshow/135487784.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135487784.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cant-occupy-a-site-for-all-times-sc-on-delhi-protests-against-cec-gyanesh-kumar/articleshow/135487784.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cant-occupy-a-site-for-all-times-sc-on-delhi-protests-against-cec-gyanesh-kumar/articleshow/135487784.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T13:19:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135488086,imgsize-302282.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Azam Khan, facing 95 cases since 2017, moves SC against his arrest by ED]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/azam-khan-facing-95-cases-since-2017-moves-sc-against-his-arrest-by-ed/articles